  - '?'
  - Names and favorites
  - 'Press a card to give that dog a name of your own. Only you will see it; nothing
    changes for anyone else, or for the dog. Call them whatever you like.

    Names
    can use letters, digits, hiragana and katakana, up to 12 characters. Kanji and
    emoji cannot be shown, so they are removed as you type.

    You can choose one
    favorite. When you visit, your favorite comes to say hello once when they are
    free. Now and then they may also wander over to you on their own.

    If someone
    else is petting, calling or playing with that dog, that comes first. They will
    come once they are free, so give them a moment.

    A favorite is not yours
    alone. Everyone can still play with every dog.

    Your names and favorite are
    saved and will still be here next time.'
