  - Happy Tails, Sunny Trails
  - Daytime garden
  - A pop sun and tails that never stop wagging. A bright song for the daytime garden.
  - A big sun opens the show. The dogs wag their tails to the beat.
  - Garden of Little Lights
  - Night garden
  - Small lanterns circle the garden and end in a fan of fireworks.
  - Near the end, six lanterns spiral to the center and close with fireworks in seven
    directions.
  - Petal Waltz
  - Daytime garden
  - Fairies draw a tree and petals fall. A gentle waltz.
  - Fairies rise from both sides; when they meet at the top, the petals bloom wide.
  - After the Rain, a Rainbow
  - Daytime garden
  - Seven-colored raindrops paint hydrangeas and a rainbow. A song for after the
    rain.
  - Seven drops, red to violet, share the work of drawing the clouds and the rainbow.
  - Kominka Live Pack
  - 3 songs + 3 pet effects
  - Today Is Your Day! / A Sky Full of Quiet Wishes / Garden of Light. Three shows
    and a pet effect for each (confetti / meteors / lanterns).
  - A parade around a crown and growing fireworks. The Big Dipper and a meteor shower.
    A lotus of light (112 s) opens in the night garden. Keep the mood you like for
    everyday petting.
  - Candy Step
  - Night garden, 124.8 s
  - Candy lights bouncing through the garden. A dedicated live where all six dogs
    dance to the music.
  - The lights go down and the song starts once all six dogs gather. The dogs wear
    the included accessories during the live. Wrapped candies and little stars also
    appear when you pet them.
  - Pumpkin Parade
  - Night garden, 120 s, on sale until Oct 31
  - Led by a little ghost, the dogs walk a path of pumpkin lights. A dedicated Halloween
    live.
  - Each time the ghost hops to the next light a note answers, and pumpkins light
    up along the march. At the end the dogs sit facing the audience.
  - Leaves into Stars
  - The plaza, from dusk into night
  - Glowing autumn leaves rise from the trees around the plaza and turn into stars.
    A quiet dusk song to watch beside your dogs.
  - It begins with a single leaf that grows into a slow, rising swirl. At the peak
    the leaves become stars, and the night lingers over the plaza.
  - 'Halloween event: limited live "Pumpkin Parade" on sale until Oct 31'
  - You own the Halloween live "Pumpkin Parade" (on sale until Oct 31)
  - Sale ended
  - The sale ended on Oct 31. Those who bought it can keep hosting and dressing from
    November onward.
  - "<b>Make yourself at home</b>\nYou can enjoy the usual activities without owning
    anything.\n\n<b>Pet a dog</b>\nStroke their head, cheeks, or chin, and they will
    respond.\n\n<b>Throw a ball or disc</b>\nPick one up and throw it. A dog will
    bring it back.\n\n<b>Walk together</b>\nChoose \u201CWalk\u201D in the menu.
    Put dogs on the lead and walk the hillside.\n\n<b>Rest together</b>\nChoose \u201CCall\u201D
    in the menu. A dog will come over and rest beside you.\n\n<b>What you can do
    in the menu</b>\nTime spent here earns points to exchange for things you like.\nUse
    the tabs above to walk with dogs on the lead, take out treats, or dress up a
    dog.\n\n<b>Points and Grandpa</b>\nOpen \u201CPoints\u201D at the top right to
    see how to earn points.\nTalk to Grandpa by the gate to get points for getting
    ready.\n\n<b>Bring the menu to you</b>\nVR: Hold the right stick down\nDesktop:
    Press T\nMobile: Tap [Menu] on the screen"
