  - Walk
  - 'Use Walk in your personal menu to put dogs on a leash. On a dog''s row, press
    Leash left or Leash right. Only dogs near you can be attached. You can walk up
    to 3 dogs per hand, 6 with both hands.


    Choose the destination: Plaza or
    Farmhouse-side gate. Leashed dogs head there, stopping along the way.


    Press
    Unleash to let a dog go. Only the person who attached it can release it.


    Even
    without points, you can always walk and play ball.'
