  - "\uD560\uC544\uBC84\uC9C0\uC640 \uC774\uC57C\uAE30\uD558\uAE30"
  - 'Welcome. This is the hillside behind the old farmhouse. Take a slow walk with
    the dogs.


    You can get the dogs ready in Dress in your personal menu. In
    VR, hold the right stick down. On Desktop, press T. On mobile, tap Menu on the
    screen.


    If there is anything you want to know, choose it on the left.'
  - 'Welcome. First time here? Take these for getting ready for a walk: {0} points.
    Just this once.


    You can get the dogs ready in Dress in your personal menu.
    In VR, hold the right stick down. On Desktop, press T. On mobile, tap Menu on
    the screen.


    If there is anything you want to know, choose it on the left.'
  - "\uBA54\uB274"
  - "\uC4F0\uB2E4\uB4EC\uAE30"
  - "\uAC15\uC544\uC9C0\uB4E4"
  - "\uC0AC\uC9C4"
  - "\uC1FC\uD551"
