  - O que fazer
  - 'Here are a few ways to spend your time. Try them in any order you like.


    Put
    a dog on a leash and go for a walk. Pet a dog. Throw a ball or a disc. Offer
    a treat.


    From up on the hill, you can see the old farmhouse below. Look
    back now and then.


    In Dress, you can dress up a dog and choose the light
    that appears when you pet it. With Call, you can call a dog over and let it rest
    beside you.


    You do not have to do everything. Just watching is fine, too.'
