  - Sobre a VAnimal
  - "About VAnimal\n\nVAnimal creates VRChat worlds about spending time and playing
    with animals. In Japanese, we also go by \u201CVanimaru\u201D (\u3070\u306B\u307E\u308B).\n\nA
    dog looks happy when you pet it.\nBrings back the ball you throw.\nFalls asleep
    at your feet.\n\nWe made Kominka Dog Run because we wanted to enjoy those moments
    of playing and spending time with dogs together in VRChat.\n\nKominka Hillside
    continues from there. Take a walk on an autumn hillside with the same six dogs
    from Kominka Dog Run, and look back at the old house in the distance.\n\nIn the
    future, we would also like to make worlds where you can wash and play with animals,
    or enjoy caring for them in a place like an animal hospital.\n\nBeyond creating
    worlds, we would also like to hold events such as tours of animal-themed worlds.\n\nWe
    hope to gradually add more places and ways to spend time together, enjoying all
    the different ways animals respond to us.\n\nWe share our latest news on Discord.\nYou
    can join through the link on VAnimal\u2019s VRChat group page."
  - Sobre o VAnimal Trainer
  - 'About VAnimal Trainer


    VAnimal Trainer is a time-limited membership for
    people who want to play more with the dogs.


    Here on the hillside, as a
    Trainer, you can gather the dogs or switch the Frisbee catch style.


    Take
    a group photo with everyone, or watch the different ways the dogs catch.

    Everyone
    there can enjoy the activities a Trainer starts.


    Pet a dog, throw a ball
    or disc, walk together, or have a dog sleep beside you.

    These everyday ways
    to play remain available to everyone.


    The races and two-dog play from Kominka
    Dog Run are not available on the hillside.


    Accessories, toys, and live
    performances are sold separately and are not included in Trainer membership.


    We
    would also like to offer Trainers ways to play with dogs suited to each of the
    worlds we create in the future. The activities and their release dates have not
    yet been decided.


    Choose from four membership periods:

    1 month: 500
    Credits

    3 months: 1,350 Credits (450 Credits per month)

    6 months: 2,550
    Credits (425 Credits per month)

    12 months: 4,800 Credits (400 Credits per
    month)


    Membership does not renew automatically.'
  - '?'
  - Como funcionam as fotos
  - "As fotos saem sozinhas quando um cachorro traz a bola, enquanto voc\xEA faz
    carinho e durante as corridas ou as brincadeiras entre eles. No quarto, tamb\xE9m
    s\xE3o capturados os momentos de sossego juntos.\n\nA c\xE2mera n\xE3o fica tirando
    foto o tempo todo: as fotos saem de tempos em tempos, e as novas substituem as
    mais antigas de cada tipo.\n\nEste \xE1lbum \xE9 s\xF3 seu. As outras pessoas
    veem outras fotos nos pain\xE9is delas.\n\nAs fotos somem quando voc\xEA sai.
    Para ficar com uma no PC ou no Quest, aproxime a c\xE2mera do VRChat e fotografe.
    No celular, toque na foto e fa\xE7a uma captura de tela.\n\nVoc\xEA pode desligar
    as fotos autom\xE1ticas em Ajustes de resolu\xE7\xE3o, ao lado do painel de fotos."
