  - 'Nothing in hand? The usual play is all here

    - Pet: stroke the head, cheeks
    or chin and the dog answers

    - Throw a ball or disc: pick one up and throw
    it, and the dog brings it back

    - Walk together: from Walk on this board,
    put dogs on the lead and walk the hillside

    - Nap together: from Call on
    this board a dog comes and sleeps beside you


    What this board does: time
    spent here becomes points to trade for things you like

    - Walk, Treats, Dress:
    lead a dog, bring out treats, put things on a dog. From the tabs above

    -
    Points and Grandpa: Points at the top right shows how to earn. Talk to Grandpa
    by the gate to get points for getting ready'
