  - Up to 3 dogs on your right hand
  - Please come a little closer (4 m)
  - Not available right now
  - Leashed on your left hand
  - Leashed on your right hand
  - Unleashed
  - Heading to the plaza
  - Heading back to the farmhouse side
  - Could not confirm the result. Check the board and try again
  - Ball
  - Disc
  - ready
  - held
  - playing
  - calling
  - wait
  - unavailable
  - not yet
  - Someone is holding it
  - A dog is playing with it
  - Please wait a moment
  - Already calling a toy
  - Not available right now
  - This dog has no disc yet
  - "Calling it to you\u2026"
  - Placed in front of you
  - Could not call it right now
  - That did not work. Please try again
  - Toys are placed on the ground in front of you, one at a time. Hold a disc to
    see its path; Use throws it
  - Coming soon
  - Hillside lives are coming soon
  - The shows and how to host them are still being decided.
  - Once decided, the shows will be listed here.
  - A VAnimal Trainer perk. Everyone present can enjoy the gathering.
  - Choose a shape, check the ground markers, then gather. Slots without a marker
    cannot be used there. Slopes are fine. After a minute the dogs roam free from
    where they are
  - Gather in 6 formations
  - 'As a Trainer you can gather the dogs for a group photo. Perks bought at the
    farmhouse work here too.

    500 Credits for 1 month / 1,350 for 3 / 2,550 for
    6 / 4,800 for 12. No auto-renewal; an extension adds to the remaining days.'
  - Trainer rights active on entry last for the whole stay. Everyone present can
    enjoy the gathering.
  - Gathering started
  - Gathering ended
  - Cannot line up here (too steep, something in the way, no dogs, or already running)
  - Could not end it
  - No reply
  - Could not confirm the result. Check the board and try again
  - "Gathering requested\u2026"
  - "Ending\u2026"
  - Already running
  - No dogs can gather (leashed or playing dogs are excluded)
  - Only the person who started it can end it
  - Loading purchase information
  - Gathering is a Trainer perk. Open the store to join
  - Your gathering ({0} dogs, {1} s left)
  - Someone else's gathering ({0} dogs, {1} s left)
  - Another activity is running
  - Gathering is coming soon
  - "Loading purchase information\u2026"
  - Gathering is a Trainer perk
  - 'Dogs that can gather: {0} (leashed or playing dogs are excluded)'
  - Frisbee catch style
  - 'Now: {0}'
  - 'After the dog is back: {0}'
  - Switch requested
  - Switches once the dog is back
  - Normal
  - 'Run-in: side'
  - 'Run-in: far'
  - 'Run-in: alongside'
  - Twist
  - Curve
  - Walk
  - 'Use Walk in your personal menu to put dogs on a leash. On a dog''s row, press
    Leash left or Leash right. Only dogs near you can be attached. You can walk up
    to 3 dogs per hand, 6 with both hands.


    Choose the destination: Plaza or
    Farmhouse-side gate. Leashed dogs head there, stopping along the way.


    Press
    Unleash to let a dog go. Only the person who attached it can release it.


    Even
    without points, you can always walk and play ball.'
  - Grandpa's welcome points
  - Once only. Grandpa at the entrance hands them to you
  - They add up just by spending time here
  - Now {0} pt
  - Get your welcome points from Grandpa at the entrance
  - Purchase cancelled
  - Petting effects
  - On a leash. Unclip it in Walk first
  - This pose needs flat ground
  - Called over, waiting
  - Waiting where it was called. Let it roam in Call first
  - What you see and hear
  - Everyone in this instance
  - Read
  - Personal setting; 0% mutes
  - 'Environment

    LMArt Stylized Environment Kit'
  - 'Sky

    Allsky'
  - 'Old man

    polyperfect Low Poly Animated People'
  - Leashed dogs can't come. Unleash them in Walk first
  - The dogs are gathering. Try after it ends
  - The dogs are playing frisbee. Try after it ends
  - The dogs are busy. Try after the activity ends
  - Playing with the disc
  - Can't be worn by this dog (overlaps the collar)
